# Projekt image-corpper

## Stack
- **Next.js 14** (App Router), **React 18**, **TypeScript**
- **Tailwind CSS** (design tokens w `tailwind.config.js`: `text-default`, `background-primary`, itd.)
- **Prettier** (singleQuote, semi, printWidth 80, trailingComma all) + **ESLint** (Next, TypeScript, Prettier)
- Zależności: `react-easy-crop`, `framer-motion`, `rc-slider`, `react-select`, `clsx`, `downloadjs`

## Struktura
- **App**: `app/` (layout, page, multiple/page, error, globals.css)
- **Atomic Design**: `components/atoms/` → `components/molecules/` → `components/organisms/`
- **Lib**: `lib/` (cropper.ts, helpers.ts) – logika crop i stałe
- **Public**: `public/images/` (border, dere, stats)

## Aliasy ścieżek (tsconfig)
Używaj **krótkich** aliasów, nie `@/components/...`:
- `@/atoms/*` → components/atoms
- `@/molecules/*` → components/molecules  
- `@/organisms/*` → components/organisms
- `@/lib/*` → lib
- `@/types/*` → types
- `@/assets/*` → assets

## Uruchomienie
`yarn` → `yarn dev` (localhost:3000). Lint: `yarn lint`, format: `yarn prettier`.
